    answerHTML: "<b>答：$\\sqrt{\\dfrac{3\\pi}{8}}$</b>\n<b>解：</b>令 $x-t=u$，则 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^x f(x-t)\\,\\mathrm dt=\\int_0^x f(u)\\,\\mathrm du$，于是\n$$f(x)\\int_0^x f(u)\\,\\mathrm du=\\sin^4 x,$$\n即 $\\displaystyle\\mathrm d\\left[\\int_0^x f(u)\\,\\mathrm du\\right]^2=2\\sin^4 x\\,\\mathrm dx$．积分得，\n$$\\left[\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} f(u)\\,\\mathrm du\\right]^2=2\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\sin^4 x\\,\\mathrm dx=2\\times\\frac34\\times\\frac12\\times\\frac{\\pi}{2}=\\frac{3\\pi}{8}.$$\n故 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}} f(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=\\sqrt{\\dfrac{3\\pi}{8}}$（$f(x)$ 非负，故取正根）．",
