    answerHTML: "<b>解：</b>分部积分：\n$$I=\\int_0^1 f(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=xf(x)\\Big|_0^1-\\int_0^1 x f'(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=f(1)-\\int_0^1 x\\arctan\\left((x-1)^2\\right)\\mathrm dx.$$\n把 $x=(x-1)+1$ 拆开：\n$$\\int_0^1 x\\arctan\\left((x-1)^2\\right)\\mathrm dx=\\int_0^1\\left(x-1\\right)\\arctan\\left((x-1)^2\\right)\\mathrm d\\left(x-1\\right)+\\int_0^1\\arctan\\left((x-1)^2\\right)\\mathrm dx,$$\n而第二项 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^1\\arctan\\left((x-1)^2\\right)\\mathrm dx=\\int_0^1 f'(x)\\,\\mathrm dx=f(1)-f(0)=f(1)$，故\n$$I=-\\int_0^1\\left(x-1\\right)\\arctan\\left((x-1)^2\\right)\\mathrm d\\left(x-1\\right)=-\\frac12\\int_0^1\\arctan\\left((x-1)^2\\right)\\mathrm d\\left[\\left(x-1\\right)^2\\right]$$\n$$=-\\frac12\\left(x-1\\right)^2\\arctan\\left((x-1)^2\\right)\\Big|_0^1+\\frac12\\int_0^1\\left(x-1\\right)^2\\cdot\\frac{2\\left(x-1\\right)}{1+\\left(x-1\\right)^4}\\,\\mathrm dx$$\n$$=\\frac{\\pi}{8}+\\frac14\\int_0^1\\frac{1}{1+\\left(x-1\\right)^4}\\,\\mathrm d\\left[\\left(x-1\\right)^4\\right]=\\frac{\\pi}{8}+\\frac14\\ln\\left|1+\\left(x-1\\right)^4\\right|\\Big|_0^1=\\frac{\\pi}{8}-\\frac{\\ln 2}{4}.$$\n故 $I=\\dfrac{\\pi}{8}-\\dfrac{\\ln 2}{4}$．",
