    answerHTML: "<b>解：</b>已知等式两边同时对 $x$ 求导，得\n$$g\\left[f(x)\\right] f'(x)=\\frac{x\\sin^3 x}{\\sin x+\\cos x}.$$\n又由 $g\\left[f(x)\\right]=x$，可知当 $x\\neq 0$ 时，$f'(x)=\\dfrac{\\sin^3 x}{\\sin x+\\cos x}$．\n故\n$$f\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=f(0)+\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{\\sin^3 x}{\\sin x+\\cos x}\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{\\sin^3 x}{\\sin x+\\cos x}\\,\\mathrm dx,$$\n而\n$$\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{\\sin^3 x}{\\sin x+\\cos x}\\,\\mathrm dx\\;\\xlongequal{\\;x=\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}-t\\;}\\;\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{\\cos^3 t}{\\sin t+\\cos t}\\,\\mathrm dt,$$\n故\n$$f\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=\\frac12\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\frac{\\sin^3 x+\\cos^3 x}{\\sin x+\\cos x}\\,\\mathrm dx=\\frac12\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\left(\\sin^2 x-\\sin x\\cos x+\\cos^2 x\\right)\\mathrm dx$$\n$$=\\frac12\\int_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\left(1-\\sin x\\cos x\\right)\\mathrm dx=\\frac12\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}-\\dfrac12\\sin^2 x\\Big|_0^{\\frac{\\pi}{2}}\\right)=\\frac{\\pi-1}{4}.$$\n故 $f\\left(\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}\\right)=\\dfrac{\\pi-1}{4}$．",
