    answerHTML: "<b>解：</b>当 $n\\ge 1$ 时，\n$$I_n=\\int\\frac{1}{\\left(x^2+a^2\\right)^n}\\,\\mathrm dx=\\frac{x}{\\left(x^2+a^2\\right)^n}+\\int\\frac{2nx^2}{\\left(x^2+a^2\\right)^{n+1}}\\,\\mathrm dx=\\frac{x}{\\left(x^2+a^2\\right)^n}+2n\\int\\frac{\\left(x^2+a^2\\right)-a^2}{\\left(x^2+a^2\\right)^{n+1}}\\,\\mathrm dx$$\n$$=\\frac{x}{\\left(x^2+a^2\\right)^n}+2nI_n-2na^2I_{n+1},$$\n故\n$$I_{n+1}=\\frac{1}{2na^2}\\left[\\left(2n-1\\right)I_n+\\frac{x}{\\left(x^2+a^2\\right)^n}\\right],$$\n其中 $I_1=\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{1}{x^2+a^2}\\,\\mathrm dx=\\frac{1}{a}\\arctan\\frac{x}{a}+C$．\n先计算不定积分\n$$\\int\\frac{3x+4}{\\left(x^2+2x+2\\right)^2}\\,\\mathrm dx=\\int\\frac{\\dfrac32\\left(2x+2\\right)}{\\left(x^2+2x+2\\right)^2}\\,\\mathrm dx+\\int\\frac{1}{\\left[\\left(x+1\\right)^2+1\\right]^2}\\,\\mathrm d\\left(x+1\\right)$$\n$$=-\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{x^2+2x+2}+\\int\\left[\\frac{1}{\\left(x+1\\right)^2+1}-\\frac{\\left(x+1\\right)^2}{\\left[\\left(x+1\\right)^2+1\\right]^2}\\right]\\mathrm d\\left(x+1\\right)$$\n$$=-\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{x^2+2x+2}+\\int\\frac{1}{1+\\left(x+1\\right)^2}\\,\\mathrm d\\left(x+1\\right)+\\frac{1}{2}\\int\\left(x+1\\right)\\,\\mathrm d\\left[\\frac{1}{\\left(x+1\\right)^2+1}\\right]$$\n$$=-\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot\\frac{1}{x^2+2x+2}+\\arctan\\left(x+1\\right)+\\frac{x+1}{2\\left[\\left(x+1\\right)^2+1\\right]}-\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\left(x+1\\right)+C$$\n$$=\\frac{x-2}{2\\left(x^2+2x+2\\right)}+\\frac{1}{2}\\arctan\\left(x+1\\right)+C.$$\n故\n$$I=\\int_0^1\\frac{3x+4}{\\left(x^2+2x+2\\right)^2}\\,\\mathrm dx=\\left[\\frac{x-2}{2\\left(x^2+2x+2\\right)}+\\frac12\\arctan\\left(x+1\\right)\\right]_0^1=\\frac25+\\frac12\\left(\\arctan 2-\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right).$$",
