    problemHTML: "（合工大超越卷）已知 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin x}{x}\\,\\mathrm dx=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$，$f(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin t\\cos xt}{t}\\,\\mathrm dt$，则（　　）．\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"padding:3px 32px 3px 0;vertical-align:top\">（A）$f(0)=f\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)$</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0 3px 0;vertical-align:top\">（B）$f\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)=f(1)$</td></tr><tr><td style=\"padding:3px 32px 3px 0;vertical-align:top\">（C）$f(1)=f(2)$</td><td style=\"padding:3px 0 3px 0;vertical-align:top\">（D）$f(0)=f(2)$</td></tr></tbody></table>",
    answerHTML: "<b>答：A</b>\n<b>解：</b>\n$f(0)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\,\\mathrm dt=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$\n$f\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)=\\displaystyle\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin t\\cos\\dfrac{t}{2}}{t}\\,\\mathrm dt\\xlongequal{\\text{积化和差公式}}\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\dfrac{\\sin\\dfrac{3t}{2}+\\sin\\dfrac{t}{2}}{2t}\\,\\mathrm dt$\n$$=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin\\dfrac{3t}{2}}{\\dfrac{3t}{2}}\\,\\mathrm d\\frac{3t}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin\\dfrac{t}{2}}{\\dfrac{t}{2}}\\,\\mathrm d\\frac{t}{2}=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$$\n$$f(1)=\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin t\\cos t}{t}\\,\\mathrm dt=\\frac{1}{2}\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin 2t}{2t}\\,\\mathrm d2t=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$$\n$$=\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin t\\cos 2t}{t}\\,\\mathrm dt=\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin 3t-\\sin t}{t}\\,\\mathrm dt$$\n$$=\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin 3t}{3t}\\,\\mathrm d3t-\\int_0^{+\\infty}\\frac{\\sin t}{t}\\,\\mathrm dt=0$$\n综上所述 $f(0)=f\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)$",
